quran[8]{c,v,t}:
  7,74,"Remember when He made you successors after (the people of) ‘Ad and settled you in the land. You built castles on its open plains and carved houses out of the mountains. So remember Allah’s bounties, and do not behave wickedly in the land, causing corruption.’"
  7,75,"The influential leaders of his people, who were arrogant, said to the abased, who believed among them: ‘Do you honestly think that Salih has been sent by his Lord?’ They said: ‘Surely we believe in what he has been sent with.’"
  7,76,"The arrogant said: ‘Indeed, we are strong deniers of what you believe in.’"
  7,77,So they slew the She-camel and revolted against the command of their Lord. Then they said: ‘O Salih! Bring us what you threaten us with if you are among the messengers.’
  7,78,"Then the earthquake overtook them, and by the following morning, they were lying dead in their homes."
  7,79,"So he (Salih) turned away from them and said: ‘O my people! I indeed conveyed to you the message of my Lord and advised you sincerely, but you do not like well-wishing mentors.’"
  7,80,"And (likewise, We sent) Lut (Lot) when he said to his people: ‘What! Do you practise a shameful act of indecency such as none in the world has ever committed before you?"
  7,81,"Surely, you come to males with sexual desire instead of females. Indeed, you are a people who transgress all bounds!’"
